# Robot 1's feeder: two CR servos (feeder_left, feeder_right) turn Gecko wheels on each side of the POLLEN and
# squeeze it into the flywheel. Both get the same power for Tunables.Feeder.feedSec per shot: one RB, one POLLEN.
# "launched" counts for the whole file. (The library's TwoCrServoWheelsTest checks both servos' power.)
# Run it: the "Simulator tests" button in Android Studio (all tests), or from the ftc-helper-lib folder:
#   ./gradlew :sim:scenario -Pfile=../simulator/scenarios/r1-feed-wheels.sim
robot ../robot.properties
init "R1 TeleOp"
start
expect within 4 motor launcher velocity > 1000   # spins from START
wait 1
expect launched = 0                    # nothing goes before RB
press g1.right_bumper                  # RB: fire one
expect within 2 launched = 1
wait 1
expect launched = 1                    # one RB, one POLLEN
press g1.right_bumper                  # and a second one
expect within 2 launched = 2
stop
expect error none
